# Public, non-secret local overrides may be documented here.
# Put Worker secrets in .dev.vars instead; never commit .dev.vars.

# GitHub OAuth (Phase 01, owner-only auth)
# Register a development OAuth App with callback URL:
#   http://localhost:5173/api/auth/github/callback
# and put your numeric GitHub user ID here.
# GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=...
# OWNER_GITHUB_ID=...
#
# GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET is a secret: put it in .dev.vars locally and set it with
# `wrangler secret put GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET` in production.
